msgstr "E<.MT groff@\\:gnu.org> für allgemeine Diskussionen E<.ME ;> und"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"E<.MT groff-commit@\\:gnu.org> commit activity (read-only)  E<.ME ,> which "
