"A free implementation of the B<grap> preprocessor, written by E<.MT "
"faber@\\:lunabase.org> Ted Faber E<.ME ,> can be found at the E<.UR http://"
"\\:www.lunabase.org/\\:\\|\\[ti]faber/\\:Vault/\\:software/\\:grap/> grap "
